Commands:
  dev completion                   generate shell completion script
  dev acp                          start ACP (Agent Client Protocol) server
  dev mcp                          manage MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers
  dev catalog <action> [target..]  browse and manage built-in skills, plugins and MCP servers
  dev [project]                    start dev tui                                           [default]
